{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"041bfa209c1bd8138686a87c00c5325476bd6721f47866508098b9a4f8ea9feb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":46,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"彼勒屈身，尼波弯腰；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比伦的偶像驮在兽和牲畜上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们所抬的如今成了重驮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使牲畜疲乏，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都一同弯腰屈身，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不能保全重驮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自己倒被掳去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"雅各家，以色列家一切余剩的要听我言：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们自从生下，就蒙我保抱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自从出胎，便蒙我怀搋。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到你们年老，我仍这样；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到你们发白，我仍怀搋。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已造作，也必保抱；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必怀抱，也必拯救。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"你们将谁与我相比，与我同等，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可以与我比较，使我们相同呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那从囊中抓金子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用天平平银子的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雇银匠制造神像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们又俯伏，又叩拜。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们将神像抬起，扛在肩上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"安置在定处，它就站立，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不离本位；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人呼求它，它不能答应，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不能救人脱离患难。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"你们当想念这事，自己作大丈夫。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"悖逆的人哪，要心里思想。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要追念上古的事。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我是 神，并无别神；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是 神，再没有能比我的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我从起初指明末后的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从古时言明未成的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"说：我的筹算必立定；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡我所喜悦的，我必成就。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我召鸷鸟从东方来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"召那成就我筹算的人从远方来。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已说出，也必成就；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已谋定，也必做成。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们这些心中顽梗、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"远离公义的，当听我言。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使我的公义临近，必不远离。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的救恩必不迟延；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要为以色列—我的荣耀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在锡安施行救恩。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/46.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/47.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/45.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}